#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Agglomeration` 5 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Agglomeration` 7 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
