#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Division` 7 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Metropolitan Area` 3 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Subdivision` 4 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Subdivision` 6 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 1996`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Subdivision` 5 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Subdivision` 7 EQUALS JUST `ei6 SGC 2011`
#ASSERT `Schedule VI s 1 the classification that gives the meaning of the term in the section` `ei6 Census Subdivision` 3 EQUALS NOTHING

